>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(A)\">\\(\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cc0aeae8dce11855\" href=\"?note=cc0aeae8dce11855\" title=\"20-thm-deg-join\">20-thm-deg-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GL}_1(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A&#39;\\equiv_TA\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{GL}_1(\\mathbf a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf0&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GL}_1(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A&#39;\\equiv_TA\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{GL}_1(\\mathbf a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf0&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>GL1 不等于 low：后者要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。只有另外 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 时 GL1 才推出 low。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.3.4 的性质原子化；印刷页 138；PDF 第 172 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":